{meta title='The life of a ticket', about='A state diagram - the start and the end, a choice, a fork into two jobs at once and a description under a state.'/}
{diagram:state title='The life of a ticket'}
  [*] --> New
  New --> Triage : filed
  state "In progress" as Work
  Triage --> Work : accepted
  Triage --> [*] : not a bug
  Work : the clock runs
  state Review <<fork>>
  Work --> Review : done
  Review --> Tests
  Review --> Docs
  state Merge <<join>>
  Tests --> Merge
  Docs --> Merge
  state Passed <<choice>>
  Merge --> Passed
  Passed --> Released : green
  Passed --> Work : red
  Released --> [*]
{/diagram:state}
